Band Description: Phase Drifters are a trio born from the heart of "The Collider" scene. At the core is Elara, a former particle physics grad student, who manipulates modular synths and the omnipresent PAD MM Dark Sleep samples, crafting the genre's signature sub-harmonic drones and disorienting soundscapes. Behind her, Kael provides the skeletal, yet driving, drum machine rhythms and heavily processed bass lines, often playing a vintage Hagstrom bass through multiple delay pedals. Fronting the band is Lyra, whose haunting, reverb-drenched alto vocals drift through the sonic miasma like an apparition, often using a vocoder for alien textures, sometimes layered with herself, creating a ghostly choir. Their live performances are less concerts and more sensory experiments, bathed in stark, pulsating light and deep fog.
